  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Plumping</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A pain-free lip-plumping gloss that uses first-ever VibePlump technology that vibrates volume into lips—without the burn or irritation.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Plumper</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating and Plumping</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p>- VibePlump: A plant-based stimulant that gently increases circulation for a natural plumping effect.</p><p>- Volulip: A peptide complex to stimulate hyaluronic acid and collagen production to boost the look of lip volume over time.</p><p>- Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Immediately fill in and smooth fine lines.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe on and smile.<br>-Every pair of lips is unique.<br>-Allow up to five minutes for the vibes to kick in.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-VibePlump: A plant-based stimulant that gently increases circulation for a natural plumping effect.<br>-Volulip: A peptide complex to stimulate hyaluronic acid and collagen production to visibly boost lip volume over time.<br>-Hyaluronic Filling Spheres: Immediately fill in and smooth fine lines.<br><br>Polybutene, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Octyldodecanol, Synthetic Wax, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Triethyl Citrate, Cetearyl Ethylhexanoate , Acmella Oleracea Extract, Isoamyl Laurate , Ethyl Vanillin, Kaempferia Galanga Root Extract, Sorbitan Isostearate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Linoleic/Oleic/Palmitic Triglyceride, Pongamia Pinnata Seed Extract, Passiflora Edulis Seed Oil, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Portulaca Pilosa Extract, Sucrose Cocoate, Arnica Montana Flower Extract, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Fruit Extract, Trihydroxystearin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate. May Contain/Peut Contenir [+/-]: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), D&C Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), FD&C Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), D&C Red 28 Lake (CI 45410). <251101.1b>.<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
